Implemented the onboarding checklist described in the PRD.

The main changes are in [src/components/OnboardingChecklist.tsx](/Users/moltbot/pp-agent-work/factory-idea-069/src/components/OnboardingChecklist.tsx), which adds the persistent checklist card with progress bar, collapse/expand behavior, localStorage tracking under `pp-onboarding-progress`, next-step highlighting, and the 5-second celebration auto-hide. I wired it into the dashboard in [app/review/ReviewDashboard.tsx](/Users/moltbot/pp-agent-work/factory-idea-069/app/review/ReviewDashboard.tsx) so it renders above the queue, and extended [app/api/reviews/route.ts](/Users/moltbot/pp-agent-work/factory-idea-069/app/api/reviews/route.ts) to return a `repos` array alongside `requests` so the checklist can reconcile against real dashboard state on load.

Verification: `npm run lint` passed, and `npx tsc --noEmit` passed. `npm run build` could not complete in this sandbox because Next.js tried to fetch Google Fonts from `fonts.googleapis.com` and network access is blocked here.

